WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:10,130
Less than a day away

2
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:12,890
Three of your friends died because of you Yuanzhi

3
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:15,290
Don't you just want to test how many bullets I have left?

4
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:17,370
Use your brother as a shield

5
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:19,730
You are really cruel. Don't listen to his nonsense.

6
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:22,220
He is sowing discord with Shen

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,660
You have a good time at home

8
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,860
Watching your neighbors starve and be affected is something you can do

9
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,300
Just beat us all to death

10
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:30,760
forty rounds

11
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:31,920
Plus what's left in the gun

12
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,840
It’s enough to give each of you one pill.

13
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,840
Anyone else want bullets?

14
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:46,100
If I had known earlier, I would have asked them to take the garbage away with them.

15
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:50,640
Today we settled these troublemakers.

16
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,840
The building can finally be quiet for a while

17
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,680
A very hungry person doesn't care what her surname is.

18
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:56,360
I'll just be more careful about this kind of thing in the future.
